{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-40","kind":"proposition","title":"等面积等底三角形位于同一组平行线之间","englishTitle":"Equal triangles which are on equal bases and on the same side are also in the same parallels.","book":1,"number":40,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.40","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.40/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":40,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-40@raw-34e9c9a132a32787","contentId":"euclid-1-40","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"34e9c9a132a327872f2009c5193c6dd8e3390f1710e1b574ac2f9568b3118055","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-40.statement","euclid-1-40.construction.1","euclid-1-40.proof.1","euclid-1-40.construction.2","euclid-1-40.proof.2","euclid-1-40.proof.3","euclid-1-40.proof.4","euclid-1-40.proof.5","euclid-1-40.conclusion","euclid-1-40.historical.1","euclid-1-40.historical.2","euclid-1-40.historical.3","euclid-1-40.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-40.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-40","revisionId":"euclid-1-40@raw-34e9c9a132a32787","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d2c40d2890c6a596f312a5f140ddf118b6f6e859f5e5744407dfd1491711894f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Equal triangles which are on equal bases and on the same side are also in the same parallels."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"等同的三角形,在底边和同一侧,也处于相同的平行状态。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形其底等其形等必在两平行线内"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个三角形：它们的底和形状必须位于两条平行线之间。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-40.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-40","revisionId":"euclid-1-40@raw-34e9c9a132a32787","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"efce4c94e7a5a9cf79ea8a6d22e49774421a13d5d041d9f38131fb1f398412a3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC, CDE be equal triangles on equal bases BC, CE and on the same side."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC,CDE等量三角形 等于底边,BC,CE,在同一边"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-40.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-40","revisionId":"euclid-1-40@raw-34e9c9a132a32787","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fc93b8dfffed622b9dcfcd78da7eab495f9ddbdf94e79c5cee54694735c51855","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that they are also in the same parallels."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,它们也处于同样的平行状态。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-40.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-40","revisionId":"euclid-1-40@raw-34e9c9a132a32787","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"41c17430e79fbb79ff7da9a1f8054b76f2c6d67fe0949a258a9f557045188154","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let AD be joined; I say that AD is parallel to BE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AD连接其中;我说,AD与BE平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-40.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-40","revisionId":"euclid-1-40@raw-34e9c9a132a32787","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"efede669f11a7daebe9dc8e26005cf2f0615655378a5ab594f9acd4c92ade2bf","citations":["euclid-1-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if not, let AF be drawn through A parallel to BE [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)], and let FE be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果不是,则AF从A中抽出,与BE平行,FE连接。 [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-40.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-40","revisionId":"euclid-1-40@raw-34e9c9a132a32787","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"123a3c1b4e77a31f0a9ea66b2dfd53d970cb2f8a205f869934b9133d65570141","citations":["euclid-1-38"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the triangle ABC is equal to the triangle FCE; for they are on equal bases BC, CE and in the same parallels BE, AF. [[I. 38](/principles/euclid-1-38)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,三角形ABC等于三角形FCE;它们等于底边 BC,CE,同比BE,AF。 [[I. 38](/principles/euclid-1-38)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-40.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-40","revisionId":"euclid-1-40@raw-34e9c9a132a32787","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"13799f8cfdd9638101120811847aef51f642d558ac379e28fa8b177a9f41ec4d","citations":["euclid-1-cn-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the triangle ABC is equal to the triangle DCE; therefore the triangle DCE is also equal to the triangle FCE, [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)] the greater to the less: which is impossible. Therefore AF is not parallel to BE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但三角形ABC等于三角形DCE;因此三角形DCE也等于三角形FCE, 数量更大, 数量较小: 这是不可能的。 因此, AF 与 BE 并不平行 。 [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-40.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-40","revisionId":"euclid-1-40@raw-34e9c9a132a32787","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"10333fc9ef34ff472b3c568f61b237b1a249534695af205b4bc37598f5e92f23","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that neither is any other straight line except AD; therefore AD is parallel to BE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,除AD外,没有其他任何一条直线;因此,AD直线与BE平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-40.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-40","revisionId":"euclid-1-40@raw-34e9c9a132a32787","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"01ffb246f71c858c0aa873588bc1812f2094da18f5294ff1c7a6af82dbacd1e6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等Q.E.D。 ]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-40.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-40","revisionId":"euclid-1-40@raw-34e9c9a132a32787","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f6a6c0952db76723a622abbdde764383a8a8402ebfa75d42b988f0eb0ac02175","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两三角形其底等其形等必在两平行线内"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个三角形：它们的底和形状必须位于两条平行线之间。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-40.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-40","revisionId":"euclid-1-40@raw-34e9c9a132a32787","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ffde7fadb1816e0bbdb69a0ef02138eab2172bd152bb3ad69f30bc5cd9488882","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙与丁戊己两角形之乙丙与戊己两底等其形亦等题言在两平行线内者盖云自甲至丁作直线必与乙己平行"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：甲乙丙 和 丁戊己，三角形 乙丙 和 戊己 的底相等，并且它们的形状也相等。命题：对于位于两条平行线之间的图形，据说从 甲 到 丁 的直线必须与 乙己 平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-40.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-40","revisionId":"euclid-1-40@raw-34e9c9a132a32787","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0e92ca3d4f36185d68eb50db51301d94d33d0f16c218bcfeb2c7cc5026145269","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：如云不然令从甲别作直线与乙己平行〈本篇卅一〉必在甲丁之上或在其下矣设在上为甲庚而戊丁线引出至庚即作庚己直线是甲乙丙宜与庚戊己两角形等矣〈本篇三八〉夫甲乙丙与丁戊己既等而与庚戊己复等是全与其分等也〈公论九〉设在甲丁下为甲辛即作辛己直线是辛戊己与丁戊己亦等如前驳之"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：如果不是，如果我们从 甲 绘制一条平行于 乙己 的直线，〈本篇卅一〉 必须位于 甲丁 上方或下方。设上方为 甲庚，延伸到 庚 的 戊丁 直线是 庚己，所以直线 甲乙丙 应该与两个三角形 庚戊己 相等。〈本篇三八〉：由于 甲乙丙 和 丁戊己 相等，并且 庚戊己 结合，因此 〈公论九〉 等于 庚戊己，所以 〈公论九〉 在 甲丁 下方，如 甲辛 所示，因此 辛己 为直线 辛戊己 和 丁戊己 相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-40.source","contentId":"euclid-1-40","revisionId":"euclid-1-40@raw-34e9c9a132a32787","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8920908a31403fe2a672fd2a253edb34d85e349445bdd1a8c9c5abc2430405ff","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.40/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.40\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-40:euclid-1-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-40","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-40.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.40","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.40/","sourceLabel":"I. 31"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-40:euclid-1-38:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-40","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-40.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-38","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.40","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.40/","sourceLabel":"I. 38"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-40:euclid-1-cn-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-40","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-40.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-cn-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.40","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.40/","sourceLabel":"C.N. 1"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-1-40:euclid-1-31:explicit","id":"euclid-1-31","book":1,"number":31,"kind":"proposition","title":"过已知点作已知直线的平行线","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-1-40:euclid-1-38:explicit","id":"euclid-1-38","book":1,"number":38,"kind":"proposition","title":"等底同高三角形面积相等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-1-40:euclid-1-cn-1:explicit","id":"euclid-1-cn-1","book":1,"number":1,"kind":"common-notion","title":"公理一：等于同一事物的事物彼此相等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-parallel","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
